 scans 389–390; local explicit nine-tuple"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.2, pp. 381–382; scans 389–390; local explicit nine-tuple"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为候选九元组；结构判断后固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\">\\(A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\)</span> 为下式的有效九元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\">\\(n=|w|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle\">\\(J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 为候选配置；动作和 top 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce832179a6c70a34\" href=\"?note=ce832179a6c70a34\" title=\"73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions\">73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions</a>；闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F\\;[&amp;A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\\\&amp;\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in K\\land F\\subseteq Q\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times K\\times\\mathbf2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}\\times\\mathcal A_K)].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F\\;[&amp;A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\\\&amp;\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in K\\land F\\subseteq Q\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times K\\times\\mathbf2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}\\times\\mathcal A_K)].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\coloneqq\\{(q,i,\\gamma,j):q\\in Q\\land i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\land\\gamma\\in K^*\\land j\\in\\mathbb N\\land[(\\gamma=\\varepsilon\\land j=0)\\lor(\\gamma\\ne\\varepsilon\\land j&lt;|\\gamma|)]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\coloneqq\\{(q,i,\\gamma,j):q\\in Q\\land i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\land\\gamma\\in K^*\\land j\\in\\mathbb N\\land[(\\gamma=\\varepsilon\\land j=0)\\lor(\\gamma\\ne\\varepsilon\\land j&lt;|\\gamma|)]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}C\\to_{A,w}D\\leftrightarrow\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists i,i\\prime\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in K^+\\;\\exists\\gamma\\prime\\in K^*\\;\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\gamma|-1\\}\\;\\exists j\\prime\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:(\\gamma\\prime=\\varepsilon\\land r=0)\\lor(\\gamma\\prime\\ne\\varepsilon\\land r&lt;|\\gamma\\prime|)\\}\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_K\\;[&amp;C=(q,i,\\gamma,j)\\land D=(p,i\\prime,\\gamma\\prime,j\\prime)\\\\&amp;\\land C,D\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\land j&lt;|\\gamma|\\land(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,J_w(i),\\gamma(j),\\operatorname{top}_{\\gamma}(j))\\\\&amp;\\land i\\prime=i+d\\land\\operatorname{StackStep}_K(\\gamma,j,\\alpha,\\gamma\\prime,j\\prime)].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}C\\to_{A,w}D\\leftrightarrow\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists i,i\\prime\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in K^+\\;\\exists\\gamma\\prime\\in K^*\\;\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\gamma|-1\\}\\;\\exists j\\prime\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:(\\gamma\\prime=\\varepsilon\\land r=0)\\lor(\\gamma\\prime\\ne\\varepsilon\\land r&lt;|\\gamma\\prime|)\\}\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_K\\;[&amp;C=(q,i,\\gamma,j)\\land D=(p,i\\prime,\\gamma\\prime,j\\prime)\\\\&amp;\\land C,D\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\land j&lt;|\\gamma|\\land(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,J_w(i),\\gamma(j),\\operatorname{top}_{\\gamma}(j))\\\\&amp;\\land i\\prime=i+d\\land\\operatorname{StackStep}_K(\\gamma,j,\\alpha,\\gamma\\prime,j\\prime)].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nR^S_{A,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}^2:C\\to_{A,w}D\\},\\quad L(A)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,0,\\langle Z_0\\rangle,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}}(R^S_{A,w})]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nR^S_{A,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}^2:C\\to_{A,w}D\\},\\quad L(A)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,0,\\langle Z_0\\rangle,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{SConf}_{A,w}}(R^S_{A,w})]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>读头位置使输入始终只读且不能越过两端。接受按原书用终态，因此非擦除机也可接受；不能沿用辅助 PDA 的空栈接受。九个分量包括终态集 F；输入只读且其端标记不是待识别词的一部分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ce832179a6c70a34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ce832179a6c70a34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为字母表，$A$ 为候选九元组；结构判断后固定 $A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$ 为下式的有效九元组。$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$、$J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle$。$C,D$ 为候选配置；动作和 top 见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions]]；闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-cl